msgid "Server requires authentication"
msgstr "Server bruukt Identiteetprööv"

#. i18n: file: mailtransport.kcfg:58
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (requiresAuthentication), group (Transport $(transportId))
#. +> trunk stable
#: rc.cpp:52
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Check this option if your SMTP server requires authentication before accepting mail.\n"
"        This is known as 'Authenticated SMTP' or simply ASMTP.\n"
"      "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        Maak dit an, wenn Dien SMTP-Server de Identiteet pröövt, ehr he Nettbreven annimmt.\n"
"        Dit warrt »Authenticated SMTP« oder eenfach »ASMTP« nöömt.\n"
"        "

#. i18n: file: mailtransport.kcfg:62
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (storePassword), group (Transport $(transportId))
#. +> trunk stable
#: rc.cpp:58
msgid "Store password"
msgstr "Passwoort wohren"

#. i18n: file: mailtransport.kcfg:68
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (storePassword), group (Transport $(transportId))
#. +> trunk stable
#: rc.cpp:61
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Check this option to have your password stored.\n"
"        \\nIf KWallet is available the password will be stored there which is considered safe.\\n\n"
"        However, if KWallet is not available, the password will be stored in the configuration file.\n"
"        The password is stored in an obfuscated format, but should not be considered secure from decryption efforts if access to the configuration file is obtained.\n"
"      "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        Maak dit an, wenn Du dat Passwoort wohrt hebben wullt.\n"
"        \\nWenn KWallet verföögbor is, warrt dat Passwoort dor binnen wohrt, wat seker noog is.\\n\n"
"        Wenn de elektroonsche Knipp nich verföögbor is, warrt dat Passwoort binnen de Instellendatei wohrt.\n"
"        Dat steiht dor in en nich leesbor Formaat binnen, man wenn Een de Datei faatkriggt un dat Passwoort redig opslöteln will, is dat Formaat nich seker.\n"
"        "

